#. Key:	BloodCanyonFortress
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
msgctxt "ST_Area,BloodCanyonFortress"
msgid "피의 협곡 요새"
msgstr "The Blood Canyon Fortress"

#. Key:	BloodCanyonFortress_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
msgctxt "ST_Area,BloodCanyonFortress_Content"
msgid "왕을 섬기며 최전선에서 싸우던 전사들의 요새. 영광스러운 전사들은 마지막까지 충의를 저버리지 않았다."
msgstr "A fortress of warriors who served their king and fought upon the front lines. These glorious warriors remained steadfast in their loyalty until the very end."

#. Key:	ForestHut
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
msgctxt "ST_Area,ForestHut"
msgid "방치된 오두막 숲"
msgstr "Abandoned Forest Hut"

#. Key:	ForgottenMoonTemple
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
msgctxt "ST_Area,ForgottenMoonTemple"
msgid "잊혀진 달의 성전"
msgstr "The Forgotten Temple of the Moon"

#. Key:	ForgottenMoonTemple_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Area.ST_Area
msgctxt "ST_Area,ForgottenMoonTemple_Content"
msgid "잊혀진 교단의 성전은 이제 은빛 그림자만을 머금은 채 빛을 잃은 신도들이 다시 차오를 만월의 때를 기다리는 요람이 되었다."
msgstr "The temple of a forgotten order has become a cradle of silver shadows. There, devotees who have lost the Moon's light wait for the day when the full moon shall rise once more."

