#. Key:	Desmond_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_1"
msgid "......또다시 산 자의 발소리가 들리는군. 그 얼빠진 눈동자를 보니, 그대 또한 뜬구름 같은 소문에 휘말려 이곳까지 흘러든 모양이지"
msgstr "...Once again, I hear the footsteps of the living. Judging by that vacant look in your eyes, you too must have drifted here, lured by hollow rumors."

#. Key:	Desmond_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_2"
msgid "성수의 성지? 악마와 성전을 벌이는 고결한 터전이라 믿고 왔는가? 실상은 그대가 들은 말만큼 그리 아늑한 곳이 아니라네"
msgstr "The Secred Spring's sanctuary? Did you come believing it to be a noble haven where demons are fought? The truth is far less comforting than the tales would have you believe."

#. Key:	Desmond_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_3"
msgid "이곳에 영혼이 저당 잡힌 전사들은 악마의 기억을 찾아 바치지 않는 한, 영원히 해방될 수 없는 법"
msgstr "The warriors whose souls are bound to this place shall never know freedom, unless they offer up the memories of Demons."

#. Key:	Desmond_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_4"
msgid "자비로운 나무라 칭송받는 저 뿌리가 사실은 우리의 영혼을 강제로 묶어두고 있는 족쇄라는 사실이라네"
msgstr "That root, praised by all as a merciful tree, is in truth nothing more than the shackle that binds our souls."

#. Key:	Desmond_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_5"
msgid "정 나아가겠다면 저 너머 성수의 룬에 손을 얹게나. 그대의 영혼을 악마의 기억이 서린 심연으로 인도할 테니. 부디 죽음조차 허락되지 않는 이 굴레에서, 그대만은 무모한 승리를 거머쥐길 빌지"
msgstr "If you still wish to press on, place your hand upon the Rune of the Secred Spring beyond. It will guide your soul into the abyss where the memories of Demons linger. I pray that you alone may seize a victory within this cycle where even death offers no release."

#. Key:	Desmond_Bye
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_NPC.ST_NPC
msgctxt "ST_NPC,Desmond_Bye"
msgid "....듣기 싫다면 붙잡지 않겠네"
msgstr "...If my words weary you, I shall trouble you no further."

#. Key:	Desmond_Name
