#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,ShieldStrike_Content"
msgid "방패로 적을 타격하여 강한 충격을 준다."
msgstr "Bash an enemy with your shield, dealing heavy impact."

#. Key:	StrongWind
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,StrongWind"
msgid "강풍"
msgstr "Gale"

#. Key:	StrongWind_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,StrongWind_Content"
msgid "부채에 담긴 바람의 힘을 사용해 적을 타격한다."
msgstr "Strike enemies with the wind imbued within your fan."

#. Key:	SummonTiger
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,SummonTiger"
msgid "호아격"
msgstr "Tiger Strike"

#. Key:	SummonTiger_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,SummonTiger_Content"
msgid "범의 영혼을 소환해 날카로운 발톱으로 적을 찢는다."
msgstr "Summon the spirit of a tiger to tear through enemies with razor-sharp claws."

#. Key:	SwordWave
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,SwordWave"
msgid "태양의 타격"
msgstr "Sun Strike"

#. Key:	SwordWave_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,SwordWave_Content"
msgid "태양의 힘을 검에 담아 휘두른다."
msgstr "Empower your blade with the Sun's power and deliver a mighty slash."

#. Key:	TaoistDodge
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,TaoistDodge"
msgid "축지법"
msgstr "Groundfold Step"

#. Key:	TaoistDodge_Content
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Skill.ST_Skill
msgctxt "ST_Skill,TaoistDodge_Content"
msgid "땅을 접어 달리는 기술. 적의 공격을 빠르게 회피한다."
msgstr "Fold the earth beneath your feet to move instantly, swiftly evading enemy attacks."

#. Key:	Content_Action
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Action"
msgid "F키를 눌러서 각종 사물에 상호작용 할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Press F to interact with objects and other points of interest."

#. Key:	Content_Battle
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Battle"
msgid "마우스 좌클릭으로 공격, 우클릭으로 막기를 사용합니다.\r\n스페이스 바를 눌러 회피를 시전합니다.\r\nTab키를 눌러 적에게 집중할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Left Mouse Button: Attack\r\nRight Mouse Button: Block\r\nPress Space Bar to dodge.\r\nPress Tab to lock onto an enemy."

#. Key:	Content_Elite
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Elite"
msgid "강력한 악마를 상대할 시간입니다."
msgstr "The time has come to face a powerful demon."

#. Key:	Content_Move
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Move"
msgid "키보드 W,A,S,D로 이동하고 마우스를 움직여 화면을 전환합니다."
msgstr "Move with W, A, S, D and look around by moving the mouse."

#. Key:	Content_Save
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Save"
msgid "룬에 닿으면 영혼이 성수에 묶이게 됩니다."
msgstr "Touch the rune, and your soul shall be bound to the Sacred Spring."

#. Key:	Content_Skill
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
#: /Game/Desecration/System/StringTable/ST_Tutorial.ST_Tutorial
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,Content_Skill"
msgid "스킬은 Shift키로 슬롯 전환, Q키로 사용이 가능합니다.\r\n포션은 2번키로 슬롯 전환, 1번키로 사용이 가능합니다."
msgstr "Press Shift to switch skill slots and Q to use the selected skill.\r\nPress 2 to switch potion slots and 1 to use the selected potion."

